 "gpu": [
  "its former globals, function statics and lazily built tables are gone (lane/gpuenv, L2): per-environment state lives in struct env (csrc/engine/env.h), per-dimension state in the replay's dims, constant tables are built before main; csrc/tests/globals.sh lists what is left",
  "function nav_scratch_take: one environment-held finder and output buffer serve every search, the finder's point, heap and key arrays the arena's pf_store (PF_MAX_POINTS); a search inside another stops the program (none does) (lane/gpuarena, L3)",
  "nav_path_of and the searches make paths in the environment's path pool (arena.c path_alloc); a path is a pathref handle shared by count (path_hold, path_drop) (lane/gpuarena, L3)",
  "line 1041, function follow_parent_target: result order depends on an_entities_within_aabb's list order (container-order dependence, matches Java's entity list order)",
  "line 459, function nav_direct_path: while (1) grid walk, terminates when the target cell is reached (bounded by distance, not by a constant)",
  "line 330-340, function nav_pathable_y: do/while bounded at 17 steps",
  "the task targets, mates and partners are lrefs and the paths pathrefs; l->an (the world container) stays an address (lane/gpuarena, L3)",
  "19 trace() calls (e.g. lines 485, 507, 563, 886) write to the global trace FILE when tracing is on"
 ],
